{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_06_005_22_5_06_005_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a5de89a6db05a5126181d80fa10f73b35987e452552102f6862efbac4c062f8e",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_06_005_22_5_06_005_22:5_06_005_22:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cbfa43a354157f743eb295aacb03629add3074b079a0542a9eba3c047a6e2450",
      "text": "与令人心动的服装相伴",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_005_22_5_06_005_22:5_06_005_22:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:128b3bb9304447098f1b4bbc1bb56cf707060803dc9a098e2b19247715e7282b",
      "text": "为庆祝315 Production的纪念日，\n决定举办特别演唱会。\n为了打造充满PASSION的最棒舞台，\n偶像们齐心协力制作新曲、服装以及舞台演出。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_005_22_5_06_005_22:5_06_005_22:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b20158026e150f849e7b50fbf67bc9956bbe272321371a3953da445556cd223",
      "text": "新服装感觉会很棒啊。\n真期待做出来的成品！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_005_22_5_06_005_22:5_06_005_22:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9e4deebf7023000cbea7620061a61eaa401499260bb98a61a1ba57d6658040d",
      "text": "大家提出了各种各样的意见，\n讨论过程也很开心呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_005_22_5_06_005_22:5_06_005_22:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be2e6c617027151ca217cc74386ffe1930e8049a5434ae7dfa7a34c3eaf240a7",
      "text": "…和彩的讨论，受到了很大的启发呢。\n…有许多光靠我们是想不出来的点子。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_005_22_5_06_005_22:5_06_005_22:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:452f86335d8fe1114ed9f6b95a6e4a2d8121be68e98ab127608dd9fceafa6d15",
      "text": "是啊！和彩的各位商量的时候，\n总能冒出意想不到的新想法。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_005_22_5_06_005_22:5_06_005_22:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b9c28c10dcfb96f1ebc7a57edad8f5bd9c4891ed57a27ff8ac2259eeab86921",
      "text": "穿这套服装的话，哪怕大家各有各的个性，\n也一定都能很合身吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_005_22_5_06_005_22:5_06_005_22:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15506c24d64ef149a8c9b2f165c8fbe4f7d4db761864236173564d20506cf3a1",
      "text": "总觉得，身上都跃跃欲试起来了！\n好想快点展示给粉丝看啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_005_22_5_06_005_22:5_06_005_22:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed97aae91b0a07b75803f01fd19a4e3ed9d8c58b3903ef411bcbe8418bba6c82",
      "text": "…啊啊，粉丝们肯定也会高兴的。\n接下来的练习也更有干劲了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_005_22_5_06_005_22:5_06_005_22:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00f6e40414037b1377ef01c1496cffa5da9ee1699d4d8baa5c22cc47a314cf73",
      "text": "说起来，FRAME的各位也说今天有练习，\n干劲十足呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_005_22_5_06_005_22:5_06_005_22:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de189d3e1bd8262194e55aef67db0a90286d7825f748b31d89e6849218f3e26d",
      "text": "噢，哪个组合都气势满满啊！\n越来越期待演唱会了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_005_22_5_06_005_22:5_06_005_22:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e4975ab5fb734b624a633b728b7c1461638779c22cde09c366bb01f3e787b6d",
      "text": "…为了能以最好的姿态展现这套服装，\n我们也要继续做好充分的准备。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_06_005_22_5_06_005_22:5_06_005_22:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:856c219717fa7292b0a74b638a9396145181768e90dfc715e00f59fd93609560",
      "text": "说的也是呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
